<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Costanera dividend $45.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Costanera dividend $45.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine electricity generator Central Costanera SA said Tuesday it will pay a total of 45.6 million pesos (dollars) in dividends to shareholders for its 1996 fiscal year.</p>
<p>Costanera has already paid 10 million pesos in dividends, and will pay the remaining 35.6 million April 21, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
